{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "aa984978-9173-8af6-a3e5-8afa7a2d7c06",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:45:29-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sean Donovan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:38:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:38:56-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. I am calling about storm drain. It is full, completely full, water is not going down. It is on corner near my mother's house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:39:10-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a storm drain that's full and not draining. Let me get some details. What's the address, or the nearest address to that corner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:39:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "460 Ayrault Street. Historic Hill. The drain is on the corner right by the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:39:32-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "460 Ayrault Street. Got it. And you said it's your mother's house, so are you calling on her behalf?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:39:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I am her son. She is elderly, she does not like phone. So I call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:39:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:39:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sean Donovan."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:39:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sean Donovan. Okay. Now when did this start? Is this since the storm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:40:05-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, after nor'easter. The one from Friday into Saturday, three days ago. Storm is finished, sun is out, and drain is still full to the top. Water just sits there. Nothing goes down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:40:23-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So three days later and it's still sitting at the top. Is the water in the street, or is it staying in the gutter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:40:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It spreads across the corner, into the street. Cars drive through, big splash. Not good for sidewalk also. People walk around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:40:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Is any water getting toward the house itself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:40:54-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not yet in the house. But it is close to the walkway. I do not want to wait until it is in the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:41:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Also I have photos. I took them yesterday and this morning. I can send them if you want."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:41:17-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would help. I can give you an email for the department, or you can send them when a crew follows up. Let me see what I can do. Hang on one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:41:35-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:41:37-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry about that. So, the photos can go to the Public Works office. I'll note on the request that you have pictures from yesterday and today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:41:51-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. One question. Is this city drain or state drain? Because someone told me maybe state. If state, I call different office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:42:03-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Ayrault is a city street, so a drain on that corner would be ours. State roads are the bigger routes. I'll have it checked, and if it turns out to belong to someone else, we'll pass it along rather than you chasing it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:42:27-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That is good. I do not want to be sent around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:42:34-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I understand. Has this drain been a problem before, or is this new?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:42:42-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It fills when big rain. But this time it does not drain at all. Three days. Something is blocked, I think. Leaves, maybe more."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:42:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be debris. Crews do clear them, but after a storm they're working through a long list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:43:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. But three days is long time. Someone should look today, or tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:43:13-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll mark it as standing water with no drainage, so it's flagged properly. I'd say a crew should get to it in the next day or two, but I'll put your concern in the notes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:43:32-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I ask because I must leave soon. I am substitute crossing guard. I have to be at school corner for afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:43:44-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, then I'll be quick. Let me read back what I have. Storm drain at the corner by 460 Ayrault Street, full and not draining since the storm Friday into Saturday, water spreading into the street near the walkway. Caller is Sean Donovan, calling for his mother. Photos available. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:44:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:44:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What's the best number if the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:44:19-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0181."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:44:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0181. Perfect. And that's a landline, so it'll ring at your place?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:44:27-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. If I am not there, my mother can answer. But she speaks little. Leave message, I call back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:44:38-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll note that. And for the photos, I'll have someone in the office send you where to forward them. Or you can mention them when the crew calls."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:44:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I keep them on phone. I do not delete."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:45:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Anything else I can help with while I have you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:45:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Please send somebody. It should not be like this three days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:45:15-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you, Mr. Donovan. It's in the system now. Go on, don't be late for the kids."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:45:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:45:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye, take care."
    }
  ],
